<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  <body class="flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-white font-sans text-ink">
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>

    <main class="flex-grow">
      <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan via-cyan-mid to-cyan-deep text-white">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-28 -top-32 h-[520px] w-[700px] rounded-[48%] border-[76px] border-white/10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-44 bottom-[-260px] h-[620px] w-[760px] rounded-[50%] border-[88px] border-white/10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-14 lg:px-10 lg:py-16">
          <div class="dv-reveal max-w-[720px]" data-delay="0">
            <p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-white/80">
              <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              Legal &amp; platform terms
            </p>
            <h1 class="max-w-[720px] text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-.05em] sm:text-5xl">
              Terms &amp; Conditions
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-[640px] text-base leading-7 text-white/85 sm:text-lg">
              These terms govern your use of the DxValley platform and its programs, operated by the Cooperative Bank of Oromia.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white/70">Effective January 1, <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> &middot; Version v<%= new Date().getFullYear() %>.1</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-6 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] lg:gap-14 lg:px-10 lg:py-16">
          <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-8 lg:self-start">
            <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-orange">Contents</p>
            <nav class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 border-l-2 border-line pl-4 text-sm font-semibold text-muted" aria-label="Terms table of contents">
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#use">Use of the platform</a>
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#programs">Applications &amp; programs</a>
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#ip">Intellectual property</a>
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#privacy">Privacy</a>
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#liability">Limitation of liability</a>
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#law">Governing law</a>
              <a class="transition hover:text-cyan-dark hover:underline" href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </nav>
          </aside>

          <div class="divide-y divide-line text-sm leading-7">
            <article id="use" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">1. Use of the platform</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">By accessing the DxValley platform, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. You must be at least 18 years old, provide accurate registration information, and keep your account credentials confidential.</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-muted">You may not misuse the platform — including attempting unauthorized access, uploading malicious content, or sharing misleading information. We may suspend accounts that breach these terms.</p>
            </article>

            <article id="programs" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">2. Applications &amp; programs</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Submitting an application does not guarantee acceptance; decisions are made at our discretion. Participation is governed by these terms and any program-specific agreement provided at acceptance.</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Application information must be accurate and complete. Misrepresentation may result in rejection or removal from a program. Unless otherwise agreed, participation creates no employment or partnership relationship and transfers no ownership interest.</p>
            </article>

            <article id="ip" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">3. Intellectual property</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">The platform and its content are owned by or licensed to us. You are granted a limited, non-transferable license to use the platform for lawful purposes. Our names and marks may not be used without prior written consent.</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-muted">You retain ownership of content you submit, granting us a limited license to store and use it to operate the platform. You confirm your content does not infringe the rights of others.</p>
            </article>

            <article id="privacy" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">4. Privacy</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">We process personal information in line with applicable data protection laws to operate the platform, manage applications, and share program updates. We do not sell your data. Contact us to access, correct, or delete your information.</p>
            </article>

            <article id="liability" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">The platform is provided "as is" and "as available". To the fullest extent permitted by law, we and our affiliates are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform or participation in programs.</p>
            </article>

            <article id="law" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">6. Governing law &amp; changes</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Democratic Republic of Ethiopia; disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Addis Ababa.</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-muted">We may update these terms from time to time, indicating the latest revision date at the top of this page. Continued use of the platform after changes take effect constitutes acceptance.</p>
            </article>

            <article id="contact" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] text-cyan-dark">7. Contact</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Questions? Email <a class="font-bold text-cyan-dark underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-orange" href="mailto:hello@dxvalley.com">hello@dxvalley.com</a>, or visit DxValley Incubation Center, Cooperative Bank of Oromia, Addis Ababa. Support hours are Monday–Friday, 8:30 AM–5:30 PM (EAT).</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>

    <script>
      (() => {
        const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll('.dv-reveal');
        if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
          const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {
            entries.forEach((entry) => {
              if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
              entry.target.style.animationDelay = `${entry.target.dataset.delay || 0}ms`;
              entry.target.classList.add('dv-visible');
              observer.unobserve(entry.target);
            });
          }, { threshold: 0.12 });
          revealItems.forEach((item) => revealObserver.observe(item));
        } else {
          revealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('dv-visible'));
        }
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
